{"parse": {"title": "7TH-23", "pageid": 55162, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-22\" title=\"7TH-22\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">7TH-23</span><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-24\" title=\"7TH-24\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">7TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">23</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A2.91.E6.96.87.E8.BE.9E.E4.B9.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"碑文辞书\">碑文辞书</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 碑文辞书</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Rosetta Stone</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>许<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>世<span class=\"color-value\"></span>界<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>第<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>本<span class=\"color-value\"></span>三<span class=\"color-value\"></span>语<span class=\"color-value\"></span>词<span class=\"color-value\"></span>典<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10723</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，我们并不知悉这一情况。维也纳调查员传回术式时，我和37刚刚进入试炼地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>收音机那头的声音暗了下去，无线电小姐强打精神，尽力捕捉那飘忽不定的信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我明白了，感谢您对研究现状不吝解释，露西女士。我会将这一情况告知阿派朗学派的成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>真的能够记住这么多技术和数字细节吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……如果您方便的话，可否等我们架设通讯设备后，请您再次为她们说明这些情况？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这势必是洞穴研究室开凿以来最为热闹的一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>之前散落的文件已经被全部收拢，幸存的整数们也参与到了研究室的整理中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无线电小姐被庄重地放在IDM旁边，仿佛是神庙前的贡品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>计算机的屏幕亮了起来，一个熟悉的声音正从里面传出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>那么接下来你们需要装置感声元件。当然了，你们手边没有也很正常～星锑，你去找……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你在说什么？伟大的唱片骑师怎么可能没有这种东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我可是一有空就去和海豚打好关系，指望它们把APPLeⅡ号上的电台设备叼回来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——还真让我回收了不少！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑兴致勃勃地说着，将感声元件装到了IDM上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>喂，喂喂——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨大的杂音令众人立刻捂住了耳朵。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好的，我想你们现在就多了一个含扩音器的通讯线路。毕竟你们不能所有人都把耳朵贴在收音机上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>——噢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-615701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅴ：</div><div>天啊，发生什么事了？轰炸机又打过来了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不不，这只是我们的同僚兔毛手袋在工作。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帮助司辰小队架设通讯设备的任务已经完成了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X站起来，小心地绕开同僚制造的一地混乱，悠哉地给自己泡了一杯卡布奇诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>维尔汀，你们那边的情况还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>距离“暴雨”落下只有8个小时了，小岛的“免疫区”停止缩小了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想是的，免疫区的衰减已经停止了，“暴雨”症候没有侵入传道者之厅以内的岛上区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>它似乎进入了一个暂时的稳定态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……毕竟，重塑之手和人类都已经离开，这座岛也不会再承受更多破坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>唔，这么说来，它的衰减不是线性的，受到岛民对真理的态度影响，而且达到一定程度就会停止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X放下了咖啡杯，思索起自己在这段闲聊中获取的新信息来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>难道岛民信仰所构成的巨大术式，仅仅是对岛屿免疫“暴雨”范围的增幅？嗯，这很有趣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>——那个等会再说，X研究员。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>性情急躁的磁流体带着更重要的课题插了进来，打断了X的侃侃而谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼下，有太多十万火急的研究讨论正等待着接入聊天线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>我想确认一件事，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>有关37小姐在地下洞穴询问的问题——“如何才能不受现象世界的黑暗所绊，一劳永逸地自灵性的‘流溢’中幸免。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>如果我没有理解错，这个问题几乎等价于询问免疫“暴雨”的办法。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_37wentian4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_37wentian4\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_37wentian4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian4.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian4.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian4.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的。据37所说，她有限的躯体无法承受这个真理。无限定者回答了一串异响，光是听到就足以让人心智失常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>随后，6给予的卷轴摊开，将其转译为一串数字，我们的答案由此得来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>对，这正是问题的关键！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>我们双方在同一时间，获得了同一个问题的答案，免疫“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>如果我没有想错，这就是罗塞塔石碑，司辰！——我们得到了一个罗塞塔石碑！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体的声音越发激动，它已经完全沉浸在了玻璃缸脑内的小小世界中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与之对应的，它听众的注意力正逐渐流失，变为一个发自内心的问号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>罗塞塔……石碑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，我来为诸位解释吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人的声音适时地出现，为这跨越性的理解鸿沟递上了一块木板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>在罗塞塔石碑上刻着同一段诏书的三种语言版本，分别是圣书体、世俗体、古希腊文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>圣书体是献给神明的语言，世俗体是平民使用的文字，这二者都是古埃及象形文字，在石碑发掘时已彻底失传。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而古希腊文则是今人可阅读的，于是，借由三段文字的对照，人们最终破译了这些古埃及文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——现在我们也有三种语言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>第一段圣书体，是37小姐在洞穴中聆听的真理。仅仅听到，就会让人心智失常，完全不可解析。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>第二段世俗体，是我们目前截获的原始术式。一旦念出，就会招致诅咒，常人无法掌握。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-308614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>第三段古希腊文，是您分享的数字密码，我们可以掌握。它本身不具备神力，却可以帮我们解开前二者的奥秘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——太有趣了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37的声音兴奋地插入了通讯线路里，这个比喻无疑勾起了她的兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你是说，我们双方的研究合并起来，就可能触及更深层的秘辛，获得只属于神明的知识……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>正是！我们探寻的是同一个问题的答案，就像罗塞塔石碑上刻印的是同一段诏书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>而我们也获得了内容不同的有效回答，就像罗塞塔石碑上的三种语言！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>如果我们能借此加深对它的本质理解，掌握术式深层的奥秘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>那么最终，我们就有可能把它转译成一个无副作用的、所有人都能使用的、一劳永逸的有效版本！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>唔噢——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>一定是这样的，因为宇宙在任何地方都是齐一的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>很高兴您能这么想，37小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯那头的女孩也被这样伟大的创想打动了。这无疑是一场成功的电波相会，磁流体感动地在玻璃缸内打起了旋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可惜，它的上司是一个实用主义者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你的假说里有太多的“如果”了，乌尔里希组长。它缺乏进一步的完善和验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们已经得到了切实有效的咒文，眼下应该沿着这条道路继续前行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人无情中断了破译组长的滔滔不绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对机器而言，现在有更具现实意义和可行性的课题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但您刚刚说到转译——这的确是术式改良的关键，司辰的描述中也有这至关重要的一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是的，您描述里的卷轴，“能助人跨越与伟大存在交感时的灵性鸿沟。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是它将不可知的异响翻译为了数字，规避了致死的副作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是否意味着……<b>它也能够有效降低免疫咒文的副作用？</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>实验室内的所有成员意识到了事情的关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不论从哪个方向攻克课题，副作用都是最需解决的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在，它出现了——神秘学的诅咒理应能通过神秘学的方式消除。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>等一下，露西女士，这里让我来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——我们想要调查这个卷轴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>如果贵方愿意将这个卷轴临时出借，研究将会有突飞猛进的进展，我们也会为学派提供一切后续所需的支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——破译组长的热心没能赶上，机器直截了当的电磁音已经先一步抵达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体变成了一滴汗水的形状，通讯设备另一头的神秘学家们的神情也因此而变色。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_dongxueyanjiushi_bianyi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>分享卷轴——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正在整理资料的协理人从研究室的一角站了起来，神情多少有些不可思议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>您是说，要我们将学派宝贵的遗产、不传的缄默之秘——授予你们，一个主要服务于人类的科研组织？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究室内陷入了沉默，沉默预示着问题的严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对一个以守秘为原则的教派而言，这无异于触及它们誓言的核心、信仰的咽喉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而回答她的依然是那道清脆的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——那道永不缺席的质疑之声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——为什么不能？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这也是为了真理，不是吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "7TH-23"}}